# los-tv patch series.  One line per patch: <project>\t<patch file>.
# Lines are grouped by project; apply-patches.sh applies all remaining
# patches of a project with a single `git am -3`.
#
# A patch whose `From <hash>` commit already exists in the project history
# (e.g. the device tree comes from the public los-tv branch) is skipped
# individually; the other patches of the same project are still applied.
# vendor/lineage is intentionally absent: upstream 1a4ed79a already has
# security patch 2026-11-01.  The old local pin to 2026-10-01 is kept in
# patches/vendor/lineage/ for history but must not be applied.

